    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>It's not just a plateau though. It doesn't feel like a \"rest\" is needed. It feels more like the engine is gone. Like the person who used to make that stuff is actually dead, and I'm just the leftover shell. It’s exhausting pretending to be someone who still has something to offer the world when I know I have nothing. It feels like I'm just taking up space that could belong to someone who actually has a purpose.",
